<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92837" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύπ-τω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύπος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cleanse, wash</i>, esp.
			with soap or lye, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. τὰ ἱμάτια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					359a22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν γλῶτταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ti.Locr.
					100e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phylotim.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.79c
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>wash oneself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				148.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.9.3
			</span></i>, f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				530
			</span></i>; aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρρύψαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.613
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λουομένη τὰς τρίχας ἐρρύπτετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					8.27
				</span></i>
			: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὅτου ᾽γὼ
			ῥύπτομαι</span> ever since I <i>began to wash</i>, i.e. from
			my childhood, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
